<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids came in under 90% of normal for November to December in 35 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025, August to September on the middle ran just 44% of normal. So far in 2026, January to February on the middle came in at 36% of normal. Grid 25688 had its driest year in 1963, at 56% of normal.</p>"}
